    "expectedRule": "Chapter 13 auctions four lots (force, guard, art, return). Legacy scrip is a run-only loot item: estate_gate gives 2, each lot dais gives 1 when collected, and a won inheritance_mimic fight drops 2. The first clear of a lot dais leaves a pending lot that blocks leaving with `遗产拍品尚未裁定，请先选择竞得、焚毁或放弃。`; law/resolve-auction-lot bids for max(1, 1 + earlier bids) scrip (no entry passive discounts here), burns for 1 or folds for 0. A claim vault (force: force_relic_gallery/archive_survey_gallery -> force_claim_vault; art: lower_bid_supply/art_relic_gallery -> art_claim_vault; ...) opens only for a bid lot; a burnt or folded lot keeps it closed with `对应遗产拍品必须竞得；焚毁或放弃后该认领区永久关闭。`. The four boss approaches need every lot resolved (`力、守、术与归返四件遗产拍品全部裁定后开放。`). Display severity is resolved once all four are resolved or frozen, danger while pending, otherwise warning; meter {resolved, 4}; targetReached when all are resolved and nothing is pending. Selecting the boss freezes the choices; in the sealed boss encounter a bid force lot gives +8% outgoing force, a bid guard lot +10% guard effect, a folded art lot gives the boss +10% art power, and a burnt lot gives nothing. inheritance_mimic_omega is an elite, so its loot offer is declined before moving on. The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
